{"2453240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Penta Terra", "steam_appid": 2453240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game for those who have always longed to immerse themselves in a living world. It is a game where you can build up your settlement across the lake from a pair of swans raising their young while skittish deer avoid wolves in a nearby forest. It is a game where ever colonist has a family, friends, and life history. This is Penta Terra!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve out rooms and build up your city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create places for residents to work, sleep, eat, and relax</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with travelling merchants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig deep for new resources and to explore the unknown</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasons, weather, and day/night cycles are all simulated and effect the city</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game for those who have always longed to immerse themselves in a living world. It is a game where you can build up your settlement across the lake from a pair of swans raising their young while skittish deer avoid wolves in a nearby forest. It is a game where ever colonist has a family, friends, and life history. This is Penta Terra!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve out rooms and build up your city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create places for residents to work, sleep, eat, and relax</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with travelling merchants</p></li><li><p class=\"